description:
Writes the reader's note on one line of a poem to their ReadingRate notes: a reading, a connection, a reaction. The line is not saved as a quote.

Use when the reader wants to record a thought about a specific line of a poem. To save the line itself as a quote, use save_poem_line. Each call adds a new note.

Example: {"anchor": "wyatt/whoso-list-to-hunt/13", "note": "The hunt as courtship, and its exhaustion."}
